# BuildKit uses THIS file (not the root allow-list, which admits only the Python
# core) for `-f deploy/e2e.engine.Dockerfile` builds. The image COPYs
# scripts/fake-agent, scripts/fake_agent_core.py and deploy/e2e.engine.toml, so
# a deny-list is used here: keep those trees, drop only the heavy/irrelevant
# ones. (The FROM is a local image; the context is only for the COPYs.)
.git
**/node_modules
**/target
web/dist
mobile/android/.gradle
mobile/android/app/build
